urce src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1777200/extras/44dbaecaa92846f25a767790170176d3.webm?t=1758029912\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1777200/extras/44dbaecaa92846f25a767790170176d3.mp4?t=1758029912\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1777200/extras/f1121ef0de148fa6e9b254a001bbea61.poster.avif?t=1758029912\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1777200/extras/f1121ef0de148fa6e9b254a001bbea61.webm?t=1758029912\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1777200/extras/f1121ef0de148fa6e9b254a001bbea61.mp4?t=1758029912\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Infiltration \u2013 Change costumes to stay unnoticed</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1777200/extras/00f23e82792607a87d59caa0521647ea.poster.avif?t=1758029912\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1777200/extras/00f23e82792607a87d59caa0521647ea.webm?t=1758029912\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1777200/extras/00f23e82792607a87d59caa0521647ea.mp4?t=1758029912\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tail &amp; QTE \u2013 Follow suspects from the shadows</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1777200/extras/b75c7d54b46dac907b9f8a7e78ffbd17.poster.avif?t=1758029912\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1777200/extras/b75c7d54b46dac907b9f8a7e78ffbd17.webm?t=1758029912\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1777200/extras/b75c7d54b46dac907b9f8a7e78ffbd17.mp4?t=1758029912\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combat \u2013 Defeat and arrest those who fight back </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >   </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >- Deduction</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All collected evidence can be organized on the <strong>\u201cDetective\u2019s Wall\u201d</strong> in your office.<br>Identify victims, suspects, weapons, and reconstruct the entire incident.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When all suspects are gathered, expose their lies and point out the true culprit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1777200/extras/86f198a219eae4b8ae4bc261febd5fd3.poster.avif?t=1758029912\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1777200/extras/86f198a219eae4b8ae4bc261febd5fd3.webm?t=1758029912\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1777200/extras/86f198a219eae4b8ae4bc261febd5fd3.mp4?t=1758029912\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reconstruct the case \u2013 Piece together the full story</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1777200/extras/febf41b30c76fce82064e2f9995c2a99.poster.avif?t=1758029912\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1777200/extras/febf41b30c76fce82064e2f9995c2a99.webm?t=1758029912\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1777200/extras/febf41b30c76fce82064e2f9995c2a99.mp4?t=1758029912\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spot contradictions \u2013 Unmask lies and reveal the culprit </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some puzzles rely on subtle sound and color cues.<br>To ensure comfortable play for all, we\u2019ve included accessibility options:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1777200/extras/c638706657834cc42c92ee4245abbbc7.poster.avif?t=1758029912\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1777200/extras/c638706657834cc42c92ee4245abbbc7.webm?t=1758029912\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1777200/extras/c638706657834cc42c92ee4245abbbc7.mp4?t=1758029912\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Audio support</strong> \u2013 Visual indicators for critical sound effects</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Color support</strong> \u2013 Adjustabl